Goal was systematizing bathos post-mortems, review schema, and a shipped corpus, plus dogfooding praxia's rig-run flows. Both PRs are open: bathos #33 (design, decisions applied) and praxia #62 (conflict-free). Next: run cargo test -p praxia-rig-tools verification_probe --lib once the box is quiet.
